  "verdict_correction_note": "2026-08-28: the original verdict logic declared the CI-clearing cell a reason to recommend the remapped mapping as default without checking direction. The actual result on patient_dropout_rate_yn/Phase1 is that remapping HURTS pooled PR-AUC (mean_delta negative, CI excludes zero) -- corrected to report this honestly rather than assume improvement. The underlying remapped_vs_shipped numbers are unchanged, only this derived verdict was wrong."
